ICML-2025-P0081,ICML-2025-A000374,Elmira Amirloo,stacked,2,4,9,"token tokens tokens tokens ... ... ... ... tokens tokens tokens tokens tokens golden retriever Raster 2D-grid tokens with autoregressive decoding golden retriever ... ... ... ... ... FlexTok Flexible-length 1D token sequences with autoregressive decoding Figure . Comparison of partial sequence generation: Raster-scan 2D-grid tokenizer vs. FlexTok. FlexTok resamples images into a 1D sequence of discrete tokens of flexible length, describing images in a coarse-to-fine manner. When training autoregressive (AR) models on FlexTok token sequences, the class conditioning (here “golden retriever”) can be satisfied by generating as few as tokens, whereas AR models trained on 2D tokenizer grids (here, LlamaGen (Sun et al., )) need to always generate all tokens, no matter the complexity of the condition or image.",-6,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P0081.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/bachmann25a/bachmann25a.pdf
ICML-2025-P0081,ICML-2025-A000375,Alaaeldin El-Nouby,stacked,2,4,9,"token tokens tokens tokens ... ... ... ... tokens tokens tokens tokens tokens golden retriever Raster 2D-grid tokens with autoregressive decoding golden retriever ... ... ... ... ... FlexTok Flexible-length 1D token sequences with autoregressive decoding Figure . Comparison of partial sequence generation: Raster-scan 2D-grid tokenizer vs. FlexTok. FlexTok resamples images into a 1D sequence of discrete tokens of flexible length, describing images in a coarse-to-fine manner. When training autoregressive (AR) models on FlexTok token sequences, the class conditioning (here “golden retriever”) can be satisfied by generating as few as tokens, whereas AR models trained on 2D tokenizer grids (here, LlamaGen (Sun et al., )) need to always generate all tokens, no matter the complexity of the condition or image.",-6,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P0081.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/bachmann25a/bachmann25a.pdf
