ICML-2025-P0088,ICML-2025-A000413,Zechen Bai,stacked,2,3,3,"Generated by Sora Impossible Type: Physical Laws -> Conservation Laws Explanation: The incomplete cookie grows over time, which is impossible. Generated by Kling . Impossible Type: Physical Laws -> Material Properties Explanation: The knife cuts towards o'clock, but the tomato is actually cut in o'clock. Such inconsistency is impossible. Collected from AIGC Community Impossible Type: Biological Laws -> Anthropomorphism Explanation: A video of fried egg speaks. We cannot tell this video is impossible by looking at a single frame, but can tell by watching the video. Generated by HunyuanVideo Impossible Type: Biological Laws -> Morphology Explanation: A rose grows from the center of a sunflower. Such specie fusion is impossible. Generated by HailuoAI Impossible Type: Social Laws -> Commonsense Explanation: A truck emerges from an underground hole and then the hole is closed, which goes against social commonsense. Generated by Sora Impossible Type: Geographical Laws -> Climate Explanation: The Merlion Park in Singapore experienced snowfall, which is impossible for a tropical country on the equator. Figure : Impossible Video Examples with Impossible Type and Explanation.",0,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P0088.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/bai25a/bai25a.pdf
