ICML-2025-P0282,ICML-2025-A001311,Adam Polyak,stacked,2,4,8,"“A ballet dancer twirls on the surface of a still lake at sunset” “A skateboarder performs jumps” “An acrobat executing a handstand on a narrow beam above water” “Fingers press into a shimmering slime ball” Figure . Text-to-video samples generated by VideoJAM. We present VideoJAM, a framework that explicitly instills a strong motion prior to any video generation model. Our framework significantly enhances motion coherence across a wide variety of motion types.",-6,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P0282.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/chefer25a/chefer25a.pdf
