ICML-2025-P0825,ICML-2025-A004111,Xihui Liu,stacked,2,2,10,"person person Two giraffes are gracefully interacting in an outdoor enclosure, their necks elegantly crossing each other. The background features a rustic wooden shelter and lush greenery, providing a naturalistic environment. Sunlight filters through the trees, casting gentle shadows on the ground. This image highlights the giraffes' majestic presence and their harmonious interaction within a wellmaintained habitat. A person casually dressed in jeans and a T-shirt is walking five different breeds of dogs on a sunny day. The dogs, varying in size and appearance, eagerly walk beside their owner. The setting is a park or open area, with clear skies and industrial buildings in the distance. This lively scene captures the dynamic energy of dog walking and the strong bond between the person and their canine companions. person horse person dog dog giraff giraff e e dog dog dog dog dog A cowboy, clad in traditional attire, confidently rides a white horse in an expansive open field. Beside the horse stands a loyal dog, attentively looking up at its rider. The vast landscape, with rolling hills and a clear blue sky, suggests a journey or adventure. This image evokes a sense of freedom and the deep bond between humans and their animals in the great outdoors. A woman and a child enjoy a walk in the park with their golden retriever. The woman, smiling A group of zebras, distinct with their black and white stripes, are bent warmly, holds the dog’s leash, while the child, over drinking from a tranquil pond. The reflection of the zebras in the water creates a mirror-like effect, enhancing the scene's beauty... dressed in a winter jacket and hat, looks excited. The autumnal setting, with fallen zebra zebra zebra zebra zebra zebra leaves and trees in the background, creates a picturesque and cozy atmosphere. This image showcases the joy and companionship of family outings and the bond with their pet dog. “A man in a green suit sits beside a large gorilla ...” “A young woman in a cowboy hat rides a horse …” “A woman in a flowing dress stands peacefully with a lion and two sheep.” (a) (c) person (b) gorilla person person horse lion sheep sheep Figure . Top: We establish HAIG- .9M, a large-scale, high-quality, and highly diverse dataset with joint keypoint-level, instance-level, and densely semantic annotations for both humans and animals. Bottom: Based on HAIG- .9M, we design U NI MC, a controllable DiT-based framework for keypoint-guided image generation, especially for multi-class (e.g., (a), (b), (c)) and heavy occlusion scenarios (e.g., (a), (b)). The bottom part of the figure showcases samples generated by U NI MC.",-2,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P0825.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/guo25s/guo25s.pdf
ICML-2025-P0825,ICML-2025-A004112,Dan Xu,stacked,2,2,10,"person person Two giraffes are gracefully interacting in an outdoor enclosure, their necks elegantly crossing each other. The background features a rustic wooden shelter and lush greenery, providing a naturalistic environment. Sunlight filters through the trees, casting gentle shadows on the ground. This image highlights the giraffes' majestic presence and their harmonious interaction within a wellmaintained habitat. A person casually dressed in jeans and a T-shirt is walking five different breeds of dogs on a sunny day. The dogs, varying in size and appearance, eagerly walk beside their owner. The setting is a park or open area, with clear skies and industrial buildings in the distance. This lively scene captures the dynamic energy of dog walking and the strong bond between the person and their canine companions. person horse person dog dog giraff giraff e e dog dog dog dog dog A cowboy, clad in traditional attire, confidently rides a white horse in an expansive open field. Beside the horse stands a loyal dog, attentively looking up at its rider. The vast landscape, with rolling hills and a clear blue sky, suggests a journey or adventure. This image evokes a sense of freedom and the deep bond between humans and their animals in the great outdoors. A woman and a child enjoy a walk in the park with their golden retriever. The woman, smiling A group of zebras, distinct with their black and white stripes, are bent warmly, holds the dog’s leash, while the child, over drinking from a tranquil pond. The reflection of the zebras in the water creates a mirror-like effect, enhancing the scene's beauty... dressed in a winter jacket and hat, looks excited. The autumnal setting, with fallen zebra zebra zebra zebra zebra zebra leaves and trees in the background, creates a picturesque and cozy atmosphere. This image showcases the joy and companionship of family outings and the bond with their pet dog. “A man in a green suit sits beside a large gorilla ...” “A young woman in a cowboy hat rides a horse …” “A woman in a flowing dress stands peacefully with a lion and two sheep.” (a) (c) person (b) gorilla person person horse lion sheep sheep Figure . Top: We establish HAIG- .9M, a large-scale, high-quality, and highly diverse dataset with joint keypoint-level, instance-level, and densely semantic annotations for both humans and animals. Bottom: Based on HAIG- .9M, we design U NI MC, a controllable DiT-based framework for keypoint-guided image generation, especially for multi-class (e.g., (a), (b), (c)) and heavy occlusion scenarios (e.g., (a), (b)). The bottom part of the figure showcases samples generated by U NI MC.",-2,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P0825.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/guo25s/guo25s.pdf
