ICML-2025-P1351,ICML-2025-A006807,Junhang Li,stacked,2,4,4,"In-distribution Fence Out-of-distribution Power Cables Snow Unseen Obstruction Representation Stroke ''Remove the Semi-Transparent Obstruction'' (b) Restormer (a) Input RainDrop Visual Encoder Mask Decoder Text Encoder (d) Instruct2See (c) LaMa ''Stains and dirt adhered to the surface of the car window.'' Mask + Visual + Textual Semantic Command Figure : We present Instruct2See, a zero-shot framework for obstruction removal that handles arbitrary obstructions. It effectively tackles both soft (semi-transparent) and hard (opaque) obstructions, while demonstrating a robust effect in both in-distribution (seen) and out-of-distribution (unseen) scenes. The right part shows how we represent unseen obstructions.",-6,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P1351.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/li25s/li25s.pdf
