ICML-2025-P1768,ICML-2025-A009114,Sergey Tulyakov,stacked,2,3,8,"(b) Multimodal composing (a) Multimodal in-context reasoning generation Predict what the next image is: + monkey + + cat + + zebra + Ground truth reasoning answer: flying zebra ""The girl holds a board showing 'Stop copy & paste. Let's Think DIFFERENT.'."" Figure . (a) Our ThinkDiff reasons over interleaved images (a flying monkey and a flying cat) and text prompts (monkey, cat, and zebra) to generate a logically correct and high-quality image (a flying zebra). The ground truth reasoning answer is provided as a reference for readers. (b) ThinkDiff composes images and texts into a coherent and reasonable image.",-6,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P1768.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/mi25a/mi25a.pdf
