ICML-2025-P2009,ICML-2025-A010308,Xihui Liu,stacked,2,5,12,"WorldSimBench Keywords: Video-Action Alignment, Physics Rules, Embodied Factors Open-Ended Embodied Environment Autonomous Driving Robotic Manipulation Visual Quality Aesthetics, Foreground / Background Consistency Evalcrafter, VBench Keywords: Text-Video Alignment Condition Consistency Instruction / Scenario Alignment … LEGO Keywords: Goal Generation Safety Key Element Perspectivity Interaction … EgoPlan-Bench, MMWorld, VAB Keywords: Task Planning Embodiment … Corresponding Benchmark Trajectory Velocity Explicit Perceptual Evaluation Implicit Manipulative Evaluation Figure . Overview of the hierarchical capabilities of the Predictive Models. Models at higher stages demonstrate more advanced capabilities. We take the initial step in evaluating Predictive Generative Models up to the S3 stage, known as World Simulators, by introducing a parallel evaluation framework, WorldSimBench. WorldSimBench assesses the models both Explicit Perceptual Evaluation and Implicit Manipulative Evaluation, focusing on video generation and action transformation across three critical embodied scenarios.",-6,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P2009.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/qin25f/qin25f.pdf
