ICML-2025-P2082,ICML-2025-A010652,Christophe Roux,stacked,2,3,3,"Riemannian optimization methods have many application in machine learning such as hyperbolic embeddings (Sala et al., ), hyperbolic neural networks (Ganea et al., ; Chami et al., ), Gaussian mixture models (Hosseini & Sra, ), the Karcher mean (Karcher, ), dictionary learning (Cherian & Sra, ; Sun et al., ), low-rank matrix completion (Vandereycken, ; Mishra & Sepulchre, ; Tan et al., ; Cambier & Absil, ; Heidel & Schulz, ), and optimization under orthogonality constraints (Edelman et al., ; Lezcano-Casado & Martı́nezRubio, ).",-6,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P2082.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/roux25a/roux25a.pdf
