ICML-2025-P2544,ICML-2025-A013078,Nisha Huang,stacked,2,4,9,"Task : Image Inversion and Reconstruction “… cake, fork, beer and orange …” Task : Video Inversion and Reconstruction “… a child holding a phone by a laptop…” “… a vibrant red train traveling through a rural landscape…” Source image Source video RFSolver RFSolver Vanilla Rectified flow Vanilla Rectified flow Task : Image Editing (resolution: × ) + “magazine” “truck” “plane” “summer” “… a giant panda walking through a snowy environment…” Task : Video Editing (resolution: × ; frames) “autumn” “woman” Source image Source video Edited image Edited video “African woman” Figure . RF-Solver for downstream tasks in image and video. We propose RF-Solver to solve the rectified flow ODE with reduced error, thereby enhancing both sampling quality and inversion-reconstruction accuracy for rectified-flow-based generative models (BlackForest-Labs, ; Zheng et al., ). Furthermore, we propose RF-Edit, which utilizes the RF-Solver for editing. Our methods demonstrate impressive performance across generation, inversion, and editing tasks in both image and video modalities.",-16,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P2544.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/wang25ce/wang25ce.pdf
