ICML-2025-P2929,ICML-2025-A015208,Muzhou Yu,stacked,2,5,5,"Overview of MindCustomer Dual Contexts Generation Visual Stimuli MindCustomer Blend Triplet Contexts Generation New Human Subject Few-Shot Generation Figure . MindCustomer seamlessly integrates visual brain signals into multi-context image generation. Given the scarcity of real-world brain data, it efficiently performs real-time single-image generation without additional inputs (e.g. masks or muti-views of the same image context). Text context is optional, which provides more semantics or control over the image and brain contexts.",-6,data/raw/icml/2025/first_pages/ICML-2025-P2929.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/yu25n/yu25n.pdf
